  "description": "All her life she’s wanted only one thing… having terrific sex. Trapped in a chaste life because of her boyfriend who’s a firm believer in “chastity before marriage,” our heroine’s been so very frustrated. But that’s all going to change on the first night of her honeymoon, right? Well, it turns out that her boyfriend’s been packing something less than ideal and her first time is a real letdown. Disappointed and upset, she dies out of pure shock…and wakes up to a God who says he’ll grant her an unfulfilled wish. Now given a second chance as Lady Elisha in another world, will our heroine be able to fulfill her wish to have so much terrific sex til she grows sick of it? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
